    "text": "Is the (standard, restricted) wreath product G ≀ H of two finitely generated\nHopfian groups Hopfian?\n   The same question where G is assumed to be abelian or nilpotent is equivalent to\nKaplansky’s direct finiteness conjecture; see (H. Bradford, F. Fournier-Facio, Math. Z.,\n308, no. 4 (2024), Paper no. 58).                        H. Bradford, F. Fournier-Facio",
